{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1270,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 180,
   "text": "# Qwen3.8-27B — model  \nOne continuous decoder-only stack L0–63, read top → bottom; layers that repeat are drawn once with **×N**. **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.08 px/channel). **Boxes = operations**, all the same size; where the parameters live is the pair of bars above. T = sequence length. Zoom in: *Layer* tab = both token mixers + FFN."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 450,
   "y": -1270,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 180,
   "text": "Layer rows — **Gated DeltaNet** (cyan): linear attention with a fixed 48×128×128 state, no KV cache · **Gated Attention** (orange): every 4th layer, GQA 24q/4kv heads × 256, KV cache grows with T. Hidden layout = 16 × (3 DeltaNet + 1 attention), every layer followed by the same dense SwiGLU FFN (5120 → 17408 → 5120).    \nDeltaNet layer **383.3M**, attention layer **372.3M**; all 64 = **24.35B**. Dense: every token uses every layer weight. The barcode on the right lists every layer in order."
  },
  {
   "id": "raw1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -960,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**raw text**  \"The cat sat…\"",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "tok2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -864,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**tokenizer** (BPE, vocab 248320)",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "ids3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 130,
